<title>USA: TABLE - Weingarten Realty Q2 net shr $0.48.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Weingarten Realty Q2 net shr $0.48.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In millions, except share data)</p>
<p>				    For the quarter ended June 30,</p>
<p>					1997		     1996</p>
<p>Rental revenues	  $	41.6		$    35.8</p>
<p>Funds from Operations	   22.0		     20.1</p>
<p>Net income per share	    0.48		     0.48</p>
<p>FFO per share		     0.83		     0.76</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>For the six months ended June 30, 1997, FFO totaled $44 million or $1.65 per share, up 8.6 percent from the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Six months 1997 rental revenues were $81.9 million, up 15.6 percent a year ago.</p>
<p>Net income per share for second quarter 1996 included $800,000 or $0.03 per share of additional nonrecurring gain on sale. Net income per share for six months of 1997 was unchanged at $0.96, and the EPS for the comparable 1996 period included an additional $1.3 million or $0.05 per share nonrecurring gain on sale.</p>
</text>
